    "note": "Official repository and Apache-2.0 license rechecked 2026-10-01. Minimal research examples, not a complete AEC frontend or the original FDKF/APA authors' implementation; no delay search, double-talk controller or residual suppressor. The original APA real-valued buffers discard imaginary components, use fixed 0.01 diagonal loading and return min(input lengths)-N samples; the chapter 6 read-only method audit records these actual observations. Legacy np.complex in FDKF/PFDKF requires compatibility checking with modern NumPy. Requirements mention librosa and pyroomacoustics; sample-audio rights are separate. Sparse source acquisition does not claim complete package or acoustic-performance reproduction.",
